# Sales Data Analysis

## Project Overview
This project analyzes sales data to identify sales trends, top-performing products, and overall business performance.

## Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- SQL
- GitHub

## Dataset
The dataset contains sales information including:
- Order Date
- Product
- Category
- Quantity
- Sales
- Profit
- Region

## Key Analysis
- Total Sales
- Total Profit
- Top Products
- Sales by Category
- Sales by Region
- Monthly Sales Trends

## Project Goals
The main goal is to analyze sales data and generate useful business insights that can help in better decision-making.

